{"unit_id":"Jockjrop__dsh-usage-stats#card-zh","repo":"Jockjrop/dsh-usage-stats","commit":"af01863613fb1de550e99cab0e3ddee187ad9034","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Usage Stats 是面向 DSH Desktop 的用量统计插件，在设置页和侧边栏仪表板展示本地会话的 Token、请求、费用与速度。它汇总按模型和供应商划分的使用数据，提供请求日志筛选、成本区间查看、价格表维护、模型名称归并、供应商余额与配额查询，以及模型指纹采样检测。适合需要在桌面端核对模型调用和支出的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Jockjrop__dsh-usage-stats#card-en","repo":"Jockjrop/dsh-usage-stats","commit":"af01863613fb1de550e99cab0e3ddee187ad9034","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Usage Stats is a DSH Desktop dashboard that aggregates local session tokens. It shows request logs, usage by model and provider, costs, provider quotas, and fingerprint sampling results. Users can filter calls, edit model prices, and merge model aliases from the settings page and sidebar.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1-20"]}
